1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,786
NARRATOR: Monday morning. The principal's office.

2
00:00:05,136 --> 00:00:09,256
PC PRINCIPAL: Alright, Chad. Emotional education assembly. Friday. The whole school.

3
00:00:09,456 --> 00:00:12,411
EMOTIONAL CHAD: Bro. I have been waiting for this my entire life.

4
00:00:12,611 --> 00:00:14,712
PC PRINCIPAL: Problem is, the kids think feelings are lame.

5
00:00:14,912 --> 00:00:20,318
EMOTIONAL CHAD: Then we don't lecture them. We show them. Feelings are reps, bro. You train them out loud.

6
00:00:20,518 --> 00:00:24,102
PC PRINCIPAL: So we make it fun. Music. Volunteers. We pull a name out of a hat.

7
00:00:24,302 --> 00:00:28,524
EMOTIONAL CHAD: And whoever comes up, we make them feel safe. Nobody gets roasted.

8
00:00:28,724 --> 00:00:29,841
PC PRINCIPAL: Nobody gets roasted.

9
00:00:30,941 --> 00:00:32,849
EMOTIONAL CHAD: Sorry. I just love a good plan.

10
00:00:37,049 --> 00:00:40,329
CARTMAN (thinking): Emotional education. Oh, this is going to be beautiful.

11
00:00:40,629 --> 00:00:44,855
CARTMAN (thinking): Two giant dweebs doing woo-woo feelings garbage in front of the whole school?

12
00:00:45,155 --> 00:00:48,204
CARTMAN (thinking): I'm going to crap all over it. It's going to be so easy.

13
00:00:48,504 --> 00:00:49,242
CARTMAN: Mwahahaha.

14
00:00:51,142 --> 00:00:52,696
NARRATOR: Friday. The assembly.

15
00:00:52,796 --> 00:00:54,841
PC PRINCIPAL: Good morning, school! Everybody breathe in!

16
00:00:55,041 --> 00:00:56,564
EMOTIONAL CHAD: And out! Let it out, bros!

17
00:00:57,164 --> 00:00:59,535
CARTMAN: Guys. Guys. This emotion stuff is for dweebs.

18
00:00:59,735 --> 00:01:03,666
CARTMAN: Watch this. I'm going to yell something so funny, the whole gym is going to lose it.

19
00:01:03,866 --> 00:01:04,688
FRIEND: Cartman, don't.

20
00:01:04,888 --> 00:01:06,285
OTHER FRIEND: Dude. They're right there.

21
00:01:06,485 --> 00:01:08,170
CARTMAN: Relax. Comedy is all about timing.

22
00:01:08,770 --> 00:01:09,361
CARTMAN: LOSERS!

23
00:01:09,561 --> 00:01:11,161
[The music stops]

24
00:01:14,261 --> 00:01:15,370
CARTMAN: Heh. Haha. Right, guys?

25
00:01:15,570 --> 00:01:18,070
[Dead silence]

26
00:01:18,170 --> 00:01:19,970
[Dead silence]

27
00:01:20,170 --> 00:01:22,170
[Still silent]

28
00:01:22,370 --> 00:01:24,370
[Every single kid is staring at Cartman]

29
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:27,470
[Somebody coughs]

30
00:01:27,170 --> 00:01:29,138
PC PRINCIPAL: Okay! Who's ready to feel some feelings?!

31
00:01:29,188 --> 00:01:29,769
EMOTIONAL CHAD: Wooo!

32
00:01:30,069 --> 00:01:32,997
CARTMAN (thinking): What just happened? Nobody laughed. Why did nobody laugh?

33
00:01:33,297 --> 00:01:36,693
CARTMAN (thinking): Am I the loser? Is everyone the loser? What even is a loser?

34
00:01:36,993 --> 00:01:40,259
NARRATOR: Eric Cartman had officially f***ed around.

35
00:01:40,609 --> 00:01:42,291
NARRATOR: And he was about to find out.

36
00:01:42,641 --> 00:01:46,021
PC PRINCIPAL: Alright, school! Time to pick our first volunteer! Totally random!

37
00:01:51,521 --> 00:01:53,236
PC PRINCIPAL: Eric Cartman! Come on down, bro!

38
00:01:53,436 --> 00:01:56,903
CARTMAN (thinking): Oh sh*t. Oh God. This is bad. This is very bad.

39
00:01:57,203 --> 00:01:59,913
CARTMAN (thinking): They're going to destroy me in front of the entire school.

40
00:02:00,213 --> 00:02:01,380
CARTMAN: I'm good! I'm good right here!

41
00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:03,528
PC PRINCIPAL: No worries, bro. We'll bring you down.

42
00:02:06,628 --> 00:02:08,162
GYM BRO #1: Up we go, little man.

43
00:02:08,862 --> 00:02:12,484
CARTMAN: SQUEEEEEEEE! NOOOOO! NOT LIKE THIS! I'M TOO YOUNG! TELL MY MOM I LOVE HER!

44
00:02:13,062 --> 00:02:15,578
KID: What the actual f*** is he doing?

45
00:02:15,778 --> 00:02:17,268
KID: Why is he freaking out?

46
00:02:17,468 --> 00:02:19,941
OTHER FRIEND: It looks like his soul is leaving his body.

47
00:02:20,341 --> 00:02:21,047
CARTMAN: AAAAAAAAAAAH!

48
00:02:24,141 --> 00:02:26,491
CARTMAN (thinking): Here it comes. Total public humiliation.

49
00:02:26,791 --> 00:02:29,612
CARTMAN (thinking): They're going to rip my soul out in front of everybody.
